    'm.photo.badge': 'Photo placeholder',
    'm.photo.s1': 'On-site intervention, laser source opened',
    'm.photo.s2': 'Training session on the machine',
    'm.photo.s3': 'Beam measurement and alignment',
    'm.photo.m1': 'Instrumented diagnosis, measuring device in place',
    'meta.description': 'CO2 LASER SERVICES, industrial maintenance specialising in photonics. On-site intervention, training, expert appraisal and preventive maintenance on TruFlow® CO2 laser sources and TruLaser® machines.',

    'p1.t1a': 'welcome', 'p1.t1b': 'to our website',
    'p1.lead': 'This space introduces our company, our craft and the way we work. We wish you a pleasant visit.',
    'p1.sub': 'Thank you for your interest in CO2 LASER SERVICES.',
    'p1.t2a': 'language', 'p1.t2b': 'profile',
    'p1.t3a': 'a glimpse', 'p1.t3b': 'in pictures',

    'p2.t1a': 'about', 'p2.t1b': 'us',
    'p2.about': 'CO2 LASER SERVICES is an industrial maintenance company specialising in photonics, founded in 2004 by its principal and hands-on engineer, Mr Laurent NAROZNI, who spent many years with the Laser 2D department of TRUMPF®, in Ditzingen, Germany.',
    'p2.t2a': 'our', 'p2.t2b': 'vocation',
    'p2.vocation': 'To provide a tailored, effective answer to your high-precision maintenance needs, and to your expectations in technical and production consulting.',
    'p2.leitmotiv': 'Our guiding principle: never settle for a quick fix, but apply intelligent corrective maintenance in order to address the root causes of faults for good, using as few spare parts as possible.',
    'p2.t3a': 'expertise', 'p2.t3b': '',
    'p2.quote': 'Working on an industrial laser calls for precise knowledge across very different technical fields: electronics, optics, automation, mechanics. It also demands considerable know-how. The success of an intervention rests on the engineer’s command of all these technologies at once.',
    'p2.trust': 'Choosing our services means securing the work of an experienced engineer, specialised in industrial laser applications since 1993, trained at TRUMPF® in Germany, and called upon by the manufacturer itself for over twenty years.',

    'p3.t1a': 'our', 'p3.t1b': 'services',
    'p3.s1t': 'Technical intervention: optimisation, troubleshooting, repair.',
    'p3.s1p': 'We specialise in particular in RF-excited CO2 laser sources of the TruFlow® (TLF) series, as well as in TruLaser® (TCL) and OEM machines.',
    'p3.s2t': 'Technical training: operation, upkeep, laser safety.',
    'p3.s2p': 'The aim: to give you the ability to operate the machine, then to carry out first-level maintenance, in line with the operating instructions, procedures and safety requirements set by the manufacturer.',
    'p3.s3t': 'Technical consulting: cutting strategies, expert appraisal.',
    'p3.s3p': 'Put our experience to work to develop or optimise your machining procedures, or entrust us with a precise, recognised machine appraisal.',
    'p3.s4t': 'Preventive maintenance: overhaul packages, service contracts.',
    'p3.s4p': 'Operations follow the manufacturer’s standards. We supply overhaul consumables and produce, on site, the demineralised water required to service your cooling units.',

    'p4.t1a': 'technical', 'p4.t1b': 'resources',
    'p4.means': 'To intervene effectively, we rely on technologically advanced tools and measuring instruments, regularly calibrated by approved services, together with high-performance computing resources and dedicated software to keep operations running smoothly.',
    'p4.t2a': 'accurate', 'p4.t2b': 'diagnostics',
    'p4.diag': 'The duration and cost of an intervention often depend on the accuracy of the diagnosis. We therefore carry out precise investigations in order to provide the most appropriate answer.',
    'p4.t3a': 'in the', 'p4.t3b': 'field',

    'p5.t1a': 'our', 'p5.t1b': 'details',
